    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Sherry are delighted to bring 4 Fingal Court to the market which is a charming and light-filled first floor apartment set within a small, exclusive development in the heart of Dunshaughlin. \n\nExtending to approximately 41 sq.m., the property is thoughtfully laid out to maximise space and natural light, with a bright living area forming the centerpiece of the apartment. \n\nPresented in excellent condition and benefiting from its own private entrance, it offers a well-designed one-bedroom unit, comfort, convenience and privacy in equal measure. Complete with private parking and every local amenity just a short stroll away.\n\n\nSpecial Features\n\n• Exclusive development of only 7 apartments\n• First floor own-door residence\n• Approx. 41 sq.m. of well-designed accommodation\n• Well-proportioned living and bedroom space\n• Built-in wardrobes\n• Private parking spaces\n• Walking distance to all local amenities and services\n\n\nLocation\n\nFingal Court enjoys a superb position just off Dunshaughlin's main street. Every convenience is within walking distance including supermarkets like Lidl/Aldi & Supervalu, cafés like Costa & Bruges, restaurants, schools, and sporting facilities. Commuters will appreciate regular bus services to Dublin city and easy access to the M3 motorway, while Dublin Airport and the city centre are both within comfortable reach.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nAccessed via its own private door, the entrance hall provides access to all principal rooms and includes a convenient storage area.\n\nLiving / Dining Room - 4.78m x 2.97m\nA bright and generously proportioned dual-aspect reception room forming the heart of the home. This comfortable space accommodates both living and dining areas and enjoys excellent natural light.\n\nKitchen - 2.61m x 2.20m\nLocated just off the living/dining area, the kitchen is efficiently laid out with a range of fitted units and ample worktop space, offering practicality and ease of use.\n\nBedroom - 4.70m x 2.52m\nA spacious double bedroom featuring built-in wardrobes and excellent floor space.\n\nBathroom - 2.61m x 1.68m\nWell-appointed with bath and shower fitting, wash hand basin and WC.\n\n"
      },
      {
